<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Ephesa</book>
  <para style="h">Ephesa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesa</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul Pasian deilam a, Jesu Khrist sawltahin Ephesa khuo a um misiengthoute leh Khrist a mi gin umte kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian i Pa u’leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist kunga kipat hepina leh hamuonna na kung uah umta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist Pasian leh pa phat in um ta hen. Aman van munte a hagaulam guolzawlna chintengin, Khrist ah eite ahing guolzawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama mai a siengthou leh genbanglou a i um theina dingin, leitung kisiem masang in Khrist ah eite itna ziehin ahing telta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama kipahna leh deilam banga Jesu Khrist zal a, Ama tate hi dingin eite itna in ahing na guotlawhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hepina thupidan pahtawi thei dinga tua amanbei a ahing piehpa ah ittahin eite ahing pomta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ah Asisan ziehin tatdohna ineita a, ahepina haudan dungzuiin ikhelnate a ngaidam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hepina ah Aman pilna leh lemtheina zousie eite lam ah ahing kiching sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman adeilam a Ama-a abawl atup bangin alungtup Ama kipahna hoitah thuguh eite kunga ahing theisah bangin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hunbi khenna bukim ahing tun chienga Ama a van a sil umte leh leitunga sil umte zousie a unpi a Khrist a khat a suhtuokhawmna dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama lunggel bang zela sil bangkim bawlpa siltup dungzui a guotlawhsa hita in Ama ah gouluo dinga guot ihita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite Khrist a muonna na nei masate athupina pahtawina ihi theina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama ah noute zong thutah thu, na hundamna uh khantanhoi na zah nua ua, gin zong na gintat nua un Ama ah chiemsa Hagau Siengthou a chiemte in na um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khu Pasian thupina pahtawina dinga gou aleisa, aneisate tatdohna hun masangsie a igouluo ding uh khaam na ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken zong Mangpa Jesu a na ginna u’leh, misiengthoute zousie tunga na itna uh ka na zah nua in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thungetnate ah na min uh louin noute zieha kipahthugen ka tawp sih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist Pasian, thupina Pa in Ama theina lam thu a pilna leh kilaahna hagau noute ahing pieh theina dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na lungsim mitte uh vahsah a hing um a, Ama hing hatna kinepna bang, ahiei chi na theina ding u’leh, misiengthoute a A goutan ding thupina hausatnate bang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh A silbawltheina thahatna nasep dungzui a ei Ama gingtate lam a, a silbawltheina thupi dan bang ahiei chi na theina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mishi lah a kipat a Khrist akaithaw a van munte a, Ama zietlam a, atousah lai a, Khrist tunga abawl silbawltheina nasep ma khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuate zousie ban ah, vaihawmnate, thuneinate, silbawltheinate leh tu hun guoh hilou a, ahing tung ding hun donga, min kiphuo zousie tunglam peh ah Ama atousah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Aman sil zousie Akeng nuoi ah akoita a, Ama pen sil zousie tunga lutang hi dingin hattuom kungah apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua khu Atahsa ahi, bangkim a bangkim sudimpa kitangchinna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh noute na bawsietna u’leh na khelna zieh ua shi khu ahing hingsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuate sungah tumasang lai in tam leitung danbangin na um ua, huikhuo a thunei vaihawmpa, tu hun a thumang lou tate sunga nasempa hagau dan bangin na hing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua thumanglou tate lah ah eite zong tumasang laiin itahsa utna ah, itahsa leh ilungsim deilam supichingin i um uhi; tualeh piendan mawnga mi dangte bangin lungthahna tate ina hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh khotuona hau Pasian in a itna thupitah ziehin eite ahing it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khiel a shi ihi lai nangawn un zong Khrist toh ahing hing sah khawmta a, hepina a hundam na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Ama toh ahing kaithou khawmta a, van munte ah, Khrist Jesu ah, ahing toukhawmsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n hun hing tung dingte ah, Khrist Jesu zieha i tunga ahoina-a ahepina hausatna thupidan a hing ensah thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hepina zieh a ginna a hundam na hi uhi, tua zong nouma a kipat a piengkhie ahi sih a, Pasian silthawnpieh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nasep zieh ahi sih hi, tuachilouin mi’n akiletsahpi kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen eite silhoi bawl dinga, Khrist Jesu a siem a um, Ama khutsuoh ihi uhi, tua silhoi bawl khu Pasian in masang lai peh a i umna dinga ana guotlawhsa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin tu masang lai a Jentelte, tahsa khuta tan teptan achite un, teptanlou ahing chite uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hun lai in noute Khrist neilou na hi ua, Israel khuo leh tui hina apat pulam mi na hi ua, thuchiem thuhun apat mikhuol, kinepna neilou leh leitunga Pasian neilou na hi uh, theizing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang, ni danglai a gamlapi a um noute Khrist sisan ziehin, Pasian in Khrist Jesu ah Ama toh ahing kinai sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama eite kilemna ahi a, ikikaal a kideidanna banglai asuchimta a, nite khu pumkhat in abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dan thupieh sunga thuguot umte kimelmatna khu atahsa a sumangin, Ama a nite khu mihing tha khat a siem dingin kilemna abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh kimelmatna khu Kross ah ashisahta a, tua ashina in nite khu tahsapum khat in Pasian toh ahing kilemsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Ama ahing pei a, nou gamlapia umte kungah lemna khantanhoi ahing gen a, tualeh nainoukhat a umte kungah zong agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama ziehin eiten Hagau khat in Pa kunga lut theina inei tuohtuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin vang mikhuol leh gamdang mi na hinawn sih ua, misiengthoute toh khotuol khat leh Pasian innkuonte na hi zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sawltahte leh guolneite suongphum tungah noute ahing lamtou hi, Jesu Khrist khu aninga suong poimaw pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama ah tua inn kilam zousie a unpi in kituohtah in asutuo a, Mangpa ah biehinn siengthouin akhangtou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama ah noute zong Hagau a Pasian tenna dinga lepkhawm na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami ziehin Kei Paul, nou Jentelte dinga suongkul taangpa in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute dinga Pasian hepina nasepna kei ang kepsah dan na zata tham ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua khu kilahna a thuguh kiphuol ka kunga ahing theisah, tumasanga tomnoukhat a na kung ua ka hing gel thute, khu ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuate na sim chieng un, Khrist thuguh kiphuol ka theidan na theisiem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khu abeisa hun dang ah Pasian in tam thuguh kiphuol mihingte kungah tambangin alangsah ngai sih hi; tuin vang sawltah siengthoute leh guolneite kungah, A Hagau ziehin alangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua khu tami ahi, Khantanhoi ziehin Khrist ah Jentelte khu gouluopite, tahsa khat a umte, thuchiem tanpite ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asilbawltheina nasepna a athawn a Pasian hepina hing kipie dungzui a, tua khantanhoi nasem dinga siem ka hing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Misiengthoute zousie lah a neupen sanga neu zaw Kei kungah, Khrist hamsatna suiseng guollou thute Jentelte kunga gen dinga tam hepina pieh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumtawn a kipat a Jesu Khrist tungtawn a sil zousie siempa Pasian a phuol a um; tua thuguh kiphuol kipawlkhawmna khu mi zousie musah dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian in atup pen khu, Pasian pilna thuo tampi van munte a vaihawmna leh thuneinate kunga hattuom zieh a tu hun a theisah a aum theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Akumtawn siltup dungzui in i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist ah asemkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama iginna ziehin eiten Ama ah hansanna leh kimuongtah a lut theina inei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute dinga ka thuohgimnate zieha lungkelou dingin ka hing ngen hi, tuakhu na thupina uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami ziehin i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist Pa mai ah ka khupdin a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lei leh van a innkuon chinteng min kiphuokhieh napa mai ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Athupina haudan dungzui a, A Hagau zieh a mihing sung lam a silbawltheina a suhhat a ahing umsah theina dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khrist khu ginna a na lungtang ua aten theina dingin, noute itna a huiha leh buldet tah a uma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />misiengthoute zousie toh aletdan, asaudan leh athuhdan, na theichien theina ding u’leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khrist itna theiphah guollou, na hing thei ua, Pasian kiningchinna zousie toh suhdim a na hing um theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n eima sunga semzel silbawltheina dungzui a inget leh ingaituo sanga thupizaw a bawltheipa kungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama kungah, Khrist Jesu ziehin hattuom ah kumtawn in akhang akhangin, tawpni neilou in thupina umdenta hen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin, kei Mangpa a suongkul taangpa in hat a na umna u’toh kituoh a gamta dingin ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kingaingiemna leh nunnemna zousie, thuohzouna toh itna kithuohzou tuo chiet in um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lemna gui a kaankhawm Hagau kipumkhatna tudet chinten un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hat a na umna pen uh, kinepna mun khat a hat na hi bangun, tahsa khat leh Hagau khat a um in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa khat, ginna khat, baptisma khat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian khat leh mizousie Pa, bangkim tunga um leh bangkim a um, tualeh noute zousie a um, a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh Khrist silthawnpie tena dungzui in hepina eite kung chiet ah ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Aman, “Tunglam a akaltou lai in, matte sal in apui a, tualeh mihingte kungah silpieh te apie hi,” chiin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Akaltou” akichi leh amasa in lei mun ngiem pen ah ahing kum suh hi, chilou bangdang china ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akumsuh penpa khu sil zousie asuhbukim theina dinga van zousie tunglam peh a, kaltoupa ma khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama mama in pawlkhat sawltah hina, pawlkhat guolnei hina, pawlkhat khantanhoi genna, pawlkhat Pastor hina, tualeh pawlkhat thuhilmi hina, apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Misiengthouten Khrist tahsa bawlhoina nna sem dinga akivon theina ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ginna leh Pasian Tapa theina lam a kipumkhat a, pichinga, Khrist bukimna latdan banga ihing um masangsie un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n dihlouna solna leh lepchie pila mihing sol a uma, thuhilna huipi chintengin alang alanga asem leeng kawi kawi naupangte ihi nawn sih ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh itna a thutah gen in, sil bangkim ah Ama lutang hipa Khrist a ikhantou theina ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman Ama a kipat in tahsa pumpi a unpi in kizopna thagui zousie in akizomsah a, aphankhawm hi, tuate ziehin tahsa hiengte chietin ama ama sep ding chiet asep chiengin, tua tahsa pumpi akhangsah a, itna ah ama leh ama kibawl hoiin akhangtousah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin tami ka gen ahi, tualeh Mangpa ah ka hing theisah ahi, Jentel dangte, lungsim mumal lou puo a aum bangun, um nawn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Atheisiemna uh suhmiel a umin, asung uah theitheina anei nawn sih ua, alungtang khau zieh un, Pasian hinna apat puse in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amauten khohsahna anei nawn sih ua, sil sienglou chinteng huoiham taha bawl dingin, numei pasal kaal a pahtatna ah akipum pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh noute’n Khrist na theidan uh tuabang ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jesu a um thutah dungzuiin Ama thu na zata ua, Ama thuhil a um na hi pouma u’leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na ni danglai hindan ua, mihing lui, misol utna zieh a kisegawp deudeu hawhkhie unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na lungsim hagau uah atha in hing um unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing tha, dihtatna leh sienthouna a Pasian kibahpi a siem pen sil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin zuou gen tawpsan in, michin in a innvengte kungah thutah gen chiet un, aziehpen eite khat leh khat kihiengtuo chiet ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungthah unlen, khiel vang khiel sih un, na lungthahna uh niin tumpi sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dawimangpa zong mun awn sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Guta in gu nawn sih henlen, tasam mi kunga pieh ding anei theina dingin, akhut a nna hoi sem in gim zaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na kam ua kipat thusie pawt sih henlen, hinanleh akhawh dan bang zel a bawl hoi dingin thu hoi chinteng pawt zaw hen; angaikhie mite kunga hepina ahi theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian Hagau Siengthou sulunggim sih un, tatna ni a dinga Ama a chiemte na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khatna, thangpaina, lungthahna, kihauna leh kigensietna te zousie na lah ua kipat koimang in umta heh, gitlouna zousie toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khatlekhat kingainatuo chiet unlen, lungnem unlen, Pasian in Khrist zieh a noute ahing ngaidam bangin, noute zong kingaidam tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin ta deinoute bangin Pasian umdan zuite hi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khrist in eite ahing it a Pasian kunga sillat leh kithoina namtui dinga akipieh bangin itna ah um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh misiengthoute umdan dinga kilawm mawng in um unlen, kingainate leh sienthoulouna zousie leh huoihamna na lah uah lawkhah in um nawn sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zummawthu leh thu mot huoi a houlimnate ahisihleh chiemmui thanghuoite akilawmlou ahi, tuate sangin kipahthu gen zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen ki ngaina thanghuoi a buol, sienglou leh huoiham mi pen milim bie ahia, Khrist leh Pasian gam ah goutan anei sih uh chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuginalou pou ah koima solzou in um sih un, tam silte zieh in Pasian lungthahna khu thumanglou tate tungah atung zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaziehin tambang sil bawlte lah ah tel sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tumasang lai in noute miel na hi ua, hinanleh tu’n pen Mangpa ah vah na hita uh, vah tate bangin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hagau gate pen, hoina chinteng leh dihtatna leh thutah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa deilam bang ahiei chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh miel nasep ga neiloute toh kipawlkhawm sih unlen, hinanleh adihloudan theisah zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen aguh a asilbawlte uh gendoh nangawn azumhuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh sil zousie adihloudan theisah a um khu vah sulat ahi, aziehpen sil zousie mutheia kilangsah khu vah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuazieh in Aman, “Nang imu khanglou inlen, mishi lah a kipat thou in, tuachi’n Khrist in ahing salvah ding hi,” ana chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n na umdan uah pilvang un, mimote banga umlou in, mi pilte bangin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nite ahoilou ziehin, na hun neisunte uh zang hoi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin mosih unlen, Mangpa deilam bang ahiei chi theisiem zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh zukham in um sih unlen, tuanah kidehzou louna aum hi, hinanleh Hagau a dimin um zaw un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian late, phatna late leh Hagau lam late a nouma leh nouma kihouin, na lungtang uah, Mangpa dingin kituohtah leh kilawm tahin la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sil bangkim ah i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist min in Pasian leh Pa kungah kipahthu gen ngitnget un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasian zaudan siemna ah khat leh khat kitulut tuo chiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zite aw Mangpa kunga na kituh lut bangun nouma pasalte kungah kitulut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Khrist khu Ama ngel tahsa pumpi, hattuom lutang leh hundampa ahimabangin, pasal khu zi lutang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin hattuom Khrist kunga akituhlut mabangin, zite khu sil bangkim ah apasalte uh kungah kitulut u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasalte aw, Khrist in hattuom a it a, ataang ua akipieh bangin, nouten zong na zite uh it un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachia amaute tui a sil a, thu a suhsienga asawpsieng theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachia hattuomte khu buohbanglou, melhemlou leh tuabang mawngmawng umlou a siengthou leh genbangloua hattuom thupitah Ama leh ama akipieh theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n pasalten zong ama uh tahsa bangbang in azite uh a it ding uh ahi, azi itpa khu ama ki it ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aziehpen koima’n ama tahsa amuda ngai sih a, Khrist in hattuom avah a akep bangin, avahin adeithaw zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aziehpen eite Ama tahsa hiengte ihi ua, Ama tahsa leh, agu hiengte ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tami ziehin pasal in anu leh apa anuasie dinga azi toh akizop dinga, tuachi’n ani un tahsa pumkhat ahing hita ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam pen thuguh kiphuol thupitah ahi, hinanleh ken Khrist leh hattuom thu ahi ka gen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahivang in na lah ua mi koipou in ama aki it bangin azi it heh, tualeh zi in zong apasal zatat dingin pilvang heh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Naupangte aw, Mangpa ah na nu leh na pate uh thu mang un, tami sil dih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nu leh na pa zatat in,” tua khu thupieh chiem nei masa pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tuachi’n nou a dingin ahoi dinga leitung ah na dam sawt ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh nou pate aw, na tate uh, sulungthah sih unlen, Mangpa thununna leh thuhilna ah entup zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suohte aw, Khrist thu na man ding bangtah un zau leh chitun pum in lungtang chitahna toh tahsa a na pute uh thu mangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing kipahsah dinga mitmei guoh veng hilou in, Khrist nasemte bangin lungtang a Pasian deilam bawl zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing nasem hilou a Mangpa nasem na hizieh un, hoi deina toh na pute uh nna sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suoh hiin zalen hitaleh michinin asep hoi leh Mangpa akipat kipahman sang ding ahi uh chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh nou pute aw, tuabangmain akung uah bawl unlen, suohte vau tawpsan un, Na ni un van ah pu kibang khat na nei uhi, Aman mi deisah tuom anei sih chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atawppen in ka unaute aw, Mangpa ah leh athahatna silbawltheina ah hattah in um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dawimangpa zebawlnate na douzou na ding un Pasian galvan bukim in kivon un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen idoute uh tahsa leh sisan ahi sih a, vaihawmnate, thuneinate, tulai hun a tam leitung miel tunga vaihawmtute leh van mun a hagau gilou umte ahi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin ni hoilou a na douzou na ding u’leh na bawlzou sieng nua ua zong na din theina dingun, Pasian gelvan bukim la un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kawng uh thutah a gahin, dihtatna awmphaw bulin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lemna khantan hoi kisahkholna khu na keng ua but in dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuateng ban ah ginna lum la un, tuakhu in giloupa thal kuongthei zousie na sumit thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh hundamna sia lukhu leh Hagau namsau Pasian thu la un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thungetna leh ngetna chintengin bangchih lai pouin Hagau ah thu ngen ngitnget unlen, tambang lungsim nei in, misiengthoute zousie dingin thuohhatna leh ngetpiehna toh, atawp dongin kiveng zing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khantanhoi thuguh kiphuol theisah dinga hangsantah a ka kam ka kaah theina ding leh thugentheina pieh a ka um theina ding in, Kei a dingin zong thu hing nget pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuami khantanhoi zieh a siakolbut palai ka hi. Tua khantanhoi ka gen ding bangtah a, hangsan tah a ka gen theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten zong bangchi khosah leh bang bawl ka hiei chi, ka tanchin na theina dingun, unau it leh Mangpa nasem muonhuoi Tikikus in bangkim ahing theisah pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka tanchin uh natheina ding u’leh aman noute ahing hamuon theina dingin, ama na kung uah ka hing sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pa Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist kunga kipat lungmuonna, ginna leh itna unaute kungah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abei theilou itna tahtah toh i Mangpa Jesu Khrist it zousie kungah hepina umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
